  "body": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yaml at v7.0.0 -->\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n### 🚀 Features\r\n* Support optional JSON output for `config`, `list`, `lookup`/`info`, `outdated` & `search`; improve tabular output by @rgoldberg in https://github.com/mas-cli/mas/pull/1230\r\n### 🐛 Bug Fixes\r\n* Output unrecognized app IDs only once for `uninstall` by @rgoldberg in https://github.com/mas-cli/mas/pull/1218\r\n* Update `README.md`, completions, `Scripts/package` & dependency comments by @rgoldberg in https://github.com/mas-cli/mas/pull/1229\r\n### Changes\r\n* Inject dependencies; cleanup; update dependency comments by @rgoldberg in https://github.com/mas-cli/mas/pull/1217\r\n* 6.0.2 omnibus by @rgoldberg in https://github.com/mas-cli/mas/pull/1223\r\n* Update GitHub labels by @rgoldberg in https://github.com/mas-cli/mas/pull/1225\r\n* JSON & misc cleanup by @rgoldberg in https://github.com/mas-cli/mas/pull/1234\r\n* Misc cleanup by @rgoldberg in https://github.com/mas-cli/mas/pull/1236\r\n* Improve documentation, improve security, improve `Scripts/mas` & cleanup code by @rgoldberg in https://github.com/mas-cli/mas/pull/1238\r\n* Improve documentation & scripts by @rgoldberg in https://github.com/mas-cli/mas/pull/1240\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/mas-cli/mas/compare/v6.0.1...v7.0.0",
